<title>USA: ADC Telecom votes two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>ADC Telecom votes two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADC Telecommunications Inc said Tuesday its board of directors declared a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable October 31 to shareholders of record on October 15. After the split, there will be about 130 million shares outstanding, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
